Package: majoris-stickies
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, gnome-shell-extension-majoris-stickies,
            poppler-utils, libnotify-bin
Description: Native desktop sticky notes for Majoris OS
 Stickies provides local-first colored desktop notes, rich-text editing,
 screenshot capture, reminders, handwriting, RTF import/export and HTML sharing,
 Archive/Trash, pinned notes, optional folder sync and offline backups.

Package: gnome-shell-extension-majoris-stickies
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gnome-shell (>= 48), gnome-shell (<< 51)
Enhances: majoris-stickies
Description: Optional GNOME Shell integration for Majoris Stickies
 Provides compositor-managed floating notes, saved positions, and
 multi-monitor arrangements on supported GNOME Shell releases.
